s":820},{"base":"H4656","lemma":"מִפְלֶ֫צֶת","tr":"miph·le·tset","gloss":"horror","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":4},{"base":"H5493","lemma":"סוּר","tr":"sur","gloss":"to turn aside: remove","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":300}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2KI","chapter":15,"verse":29,"verseEnd":29,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"In the days of Pekah king of Israel, Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria came and captured Ijon, Abel-beth-maacah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, Gilead, and Galilee, including all the land of Naphtali, and he took the people as captives to Assyria.","from":20},{"book":"1KI","chapter":22,"verse":43,"verseEnd":43,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"And Jehoshaphat walked in all the ways of his father Asa; he did not turn away from them, but did what was right in the eyes of the LORD. The high places, however, were not removed; the people still sacrificed and burned incense on the high places.","from":14},{"book":"EXO","chapter":32,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Then he took the calf they had made, burned it in the fire, ground it to powder, and scattered the powder over the face of the water. Then he forced the Israelites to drink it.","from":13},{"book":"JOS","chapter":21,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"And from the tribe of Benjamin they gave them Gibeon, Geba,","from":22},{"book":"JDG","chapter":18,"verse":29,"verseEnd":29,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"They named it Dan, after their forefather Dan, who was born to Israel—though the city was formerly named Laish.","from":20},{"book":"1KI","chapter":7,"verse":51,"verseEnd":51,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So all the work that King Solomon had performed for the house of the LORD was completed. Then Solomon brought in the items his father David had dedicated—the silver, the gold, and the furnishings—and he placed them in the treasuries of the house of the LORD.","from":15},{"book":"1KI","chapter":8,"verse":61,"verseEnd":61,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So let your heart be fully devoted to the LORD our God, as it is this day, to walk in His statutes and to keep His commandments.”","from":14},{"book":"1KI","chapter":12,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"If these people go up to offer sacrifices in the house of the LORD at Jerusalem, their hearts will return to their lord, Rehoboam king of Judah; then they will kill me and return to Rehoboam king of Judah.”","from":17}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":4},{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":3},{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":2}]},"25-34":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":8,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"asa-h0609g","name":"Asa","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":4,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"jeroboam-h3379g","name":"Jeroboam","kind":"person","brief":"King of N. Israel","count":4,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":3,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"nadab-h5070h","name":"Nadab","kind":"person","brief":"King of N. Israel","count":3,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"baasha-h1201","name":"Baasha","kind":"person","brief":"King of N. Israel","count":4,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"ahijah-h0281i","name":"Ahijah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Baasha","count":2,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"issachar-h3485g","name":"Issachar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"ahijah-h0281h","name":"Ahijah","kind":"person","brief":"A prophet","count":1,"firstVerse":29}],"places":[{"id":"gibbethon-h1405","name":"Gibbethon","kind":"place","brief":"In Dan/Philistia","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"philistia-h6429","name":"Philistia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"shiloh-h7887","name":"Shiloh","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"tirzah-h8656h","name":"Tirzah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":33}],"words":[{"base":"H1201","lemma":"בַּעְשָׁא","tr":"ba·sah","gloss":"Baasha","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":28},{"base":"H3379","lemma":"יָֽרָבְעָם","tr":"ya·rov·am","gloss":"Jeroboam","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":104},{"base":"H0609","lemma":"אָסָא","tr":"a·sa","gloss":"Asa","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":58},{"base":"H4427","lemma":"מָלַךְ","tr":"ma·lakh","gloss":"to reign","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":348},{"base":"H5070","lemma":"נָדָב","tr":"na·dav","gloss":"Nadab","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":20},{"base":"H0281","lemma":"אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","tr":"a·chiy·yah","gloss":"Ahijah","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":24},{"base":"H2398","lemma":"חָטָא","tr":"cha·ta","gloss":"to sin","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":238},{"base":"H8141","lemma":"שָׁנָה","tr":"sha·neh","gloss":"year","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":877},{"base":"H1405","lemma":"גִּבְּתוֹן","tr":"gib·b·ton","gloss":"Gibbethon","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":6},{"base":"H2403","lemma":"חַטָּאָה","tr":"chat·ta·ah","gloss":"sin","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":295}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":44,"verseEnd":44,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Eltekeh, Gibbethon, Baalath,","from":27},{"book":"JOS","chapter":21,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"From the tribe of Dan they were given Elteke, Gibbethon,","from":27},{"book":"1KI","chapter":14,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"You have done more evil than all who came before you. You have proceeded to make for yourself other gods and molten images to provoke Me, and you have flung Me behind your back.","from":29},{"book":"1KI","chapter":14,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Moreover, the LORD will raise up for Himself a king over Israel who will cut off the house of Jeroboam. This is the day—yes, even today!","from":27},{"book":"1KI","chapter":14,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So He will give Israel over on account of the sins Jeroboam has committed and has caused Israel to commit.”","from":26},{"book":"1KI","chapter":14,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"So He will give Israel over on account of the sins Jeroboam has committed and has caused Israel to commit.”","from":29},{"book":"GEN","chapter":20,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Abimelech called Abraham and asked, “What have you done to us? How have I sinned against you, that you have brought such tremendous guilt upon me and my kingdom? You have done things to me that should not be done.”","from":26},{"book":"EXO","chapter":32,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“What did this people do to you,” Moses asked Aaron, “that you have led them into so great a sin?”","from":26}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":3},{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":2}]}}